        "title": "If you've ever been curious...",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213809/If-youve-ever-been-curious",
        "content_text": "Spend a half-hour on a guided tour through two notorious Amsterdam cruising hotspots in the video <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v7VBkJjDpvM\">Inside Dirty D &amp; Eagle - Gay Cruising Clubs Amsterdam: FULL TOUR</a>. Tours given before hours so the clubs are empty. See what even people attending for a night of fun won't see because lights can be strictly forbidden. Adventurous, flirty, perhaps eye-opening.",
