        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/meta-ai.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Meta AI joined the image generation space <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/07/meta-ai-app-adds-image-generation-also-powering-whatsapp-and-instagram-features/\">this week</a>. However, it did so with a controversial default setting that users found upsetting. </p>",
