        "title": "Netflix among many companies showing interest in acquiring Letterboxd: report",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/10/netflix-among-many-companies-showing-interest-in-acquiring-letterboxd-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/letterboxd-logo-v-neg-rgb-1000px.png?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Letterboxd, the popular hybrid movie tracking and social media app, is exploring a sale. A new report this week from <a href=\"https://puck.news/newsletter_content/what-im-hearing-teds-youtube-panic-letterboxd-suitors-emmy-noms-awards/\">Matt Belloni at <em>Puck</em></a> outlines the many companies that have shown interest in acquiring the service, including Netflix, Sony Pictures, and more.</p>",
