        "title": "Deals: Apple Watch Ultra 3 $140 off, Apple TV 4K, iPhone 17 Pro/Max up to $449 off, charging gear, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/09/deals-apple-watch-ultra-3-apple-tv-iphone-17-pro/",
