        "title": "Tim Cook and John Ternus hold virtual meeting with Minister-President of Bavaria",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/07/tim-cook-and-john-ternus-hold-virtual-meeting-with-minister-president-of-bavaria/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/tim-cook-john-ternus.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Earlier today, Apple CEO Tim Cook and his successor, John Ternus held a virtual meeting with Minister-President of Bavaria, Markus Söder. Here are the details.</p>",
