        "title": "Apple acquires observability startup SigScalr",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/13/apple-acquires-observability-startup-sigscalr/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/12/Apple-Park.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has acquired certain assets and hired employees from SigScalr, the company behind the observability app SigLens. Here are the details.</p>",
