        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/07/notion-just-launched-a-brand-new-iphone-app-called-agents/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/notion-agents.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Notion Mail is out, Notion Agents is in. Last month, Notion announced that it’s <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/25/notion-shutting-down-its-ai-powered-email-client-including-mac-and-ios-apps/\">discontinuing</a> its year-old email app. Today, the company released a brand-new iPhone app called Agents. </p>",
