        "content_text": "<h1>It’s a whopping 102,040,171,200,000 pixels, making it the largest digital image ever made, period. So why won’t Guinness recognize it?</h1><p><img src=\"https://img.buzzfeed.com/buzzfeed-static/static/2023-02/13/17/enhanced/660eb9ee785a/original-4039-1676309608-11.png?crop=2006:1337;118,215&resize=1250:830\" /></p><hr /><p><a href=\"https://www.buzzfeednews.com/article/benjaminpineros/the-worlds-biggest-dick-pic\">View Entire Post &rsaquo;</a></p>",
